MAJOR_VERSION=3
STANDARD_VERSION=2
RELEASE_VERSION=0
DESCRIPTION=Persist shell command history on the FAT32 disk image (SH_HIST.TXT) when using a FAT32 volume; legacy hex disks keep host shell_history.txt. Record lines are assembled via shell_history_host_asm (GAS) with a libc fallback on the NASM host variant. Interactive line editing supports left/right arrow keys to move the cursor for corrections.
